@startuml
title Event-Driven Architecture — Retry and DLQ

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

queue "Kafka Topic" as Topic
component "Consumer" as Consumer
component "Business Processing" as Processing

queue "Retry Topic" as Retry
queue "Dead Letter Topic" as DLQ

Consumer --> Processing : Process event

Processing --> Consumer : Success
Consumer --> Topic : Commit offset

Processing --> Consumer : Temporary failure

Consumer --> Retry : Retry event
Retry --> Consumer : Retry attempt

Processing --> Consumer : Permanent failure

Consumer --> DLQ : Move to DLQ

DLQ --> Consumer : Manual / controlled replay

note right of Retry
Retry with controlled attempts
and backoff
end note

note right of DLQ
Failed messages isolated
from the main flow
end note

@enduml
